# rover_plan.in - MP8 running example at R0: a kit robot whose obstacle-inflation kernel is
# the learner's own CUDA/HIP code (goal areas of MP3/MP4 and MP6). Estimates are the
# learner's judgements in working days, not measurements. Read by F12-28's mp8plan.cpp.
# milestone <id> <optimistic> <likely> <pessimistic> test:<acceptance test> deps:<ids>
milestone M0 3 5 8    test:proposal_signed_R0                 deps:-
milestone M1 8 10 16  test:design_and_threat_model_signed     deps:M0
milestone M2 4 6 10   test:contract_tests_and_skeleton_green  deps:M1
milestone M3 5 8 15   test:device_equals_reference_all_maps   deps:M2
milestone M4 6 10 18  test:sim_task_with_cgrid_perception     deps:M2
milestone M5 4 6 12   test:latency_budget_met_on_target       deps:M3,M4
milestone M6 5 8 14   test:fault_matrix_all_pass              deps:M5
milestone M7 3 5 9    test:gameday_postmortem_reviewed        deps:M6
milestone M8 4 5 8    test:defence_dry_run_signed             deps:M7
gate R0 after:M0
gate R1 after:M1
gate R2 after:M4
gate R3 after:M6
gate R4 after:M8
